      "role": "user",
      "content": "yeah thats what i thought. i mean if it were a heart attack i'd definitely feel it in my chest right? its just a heavy feeling in my jaw. i dont really want to go to the er or anything if it's just my teeth or something dumb like that. do you think i should just take some ibuprofen and wait it out for a bit?",
